  "steps": [
    {"type":"notify","delay":1200,"fromId":"evelyn","fromName":"{{name:evelyn}}","avatar":"assets/avatars/evelyn.jpg","text":"I'm heading home now 😊","target":"conversation"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"How did it go?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Honestly, really well"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"The movie was good, and he was nice too"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"There was just one moment where I wasn't completely sure what to do"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"What happened?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"At one point, he asked if we could hold hands"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I wasn't very comfortable at first, but I accepted"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Do you think I should not have?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"You did fine"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"The goal is also to get closer to your clients, as long as it stays within what you are comfortable doing"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"If you feel okay with something, you do not have to hesitate too much"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"And usually, people add tips when you make those little efforts"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Tips?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Yes"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"I just received the transfer"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"He paid $400 for the date and added $100 as a tip"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"$500?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"For a movie and holding hands?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Yes"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"You made him feel good, and he wanted to reward that"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I really did not expect that"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I think I am starting to understand little by little"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I still need to improve, but..."},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Earning that much money while having fun and meeting people is actually pretty nice"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"That's why we take it slowly"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"You learn what feels right for you"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Thank you for guiding me through it"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I'll be home soon 😊"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"'ll make a good meal for my little manager"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Can't wait to taste it!"},
    {"type":"meetandgreet_tip","profileId":"noah","tipId":"noah_cinema_tip_01","amount":100,"label":"TIP","text":"Noah sent you a tip","onceKey":"meetandgreet_d12_noah_tip_v1"},
